Replace-From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Replace-Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 08:50:54 +0800
Subject: ASoC: histb: quiesce, mute and watch the AIAO transmit ports

A closed transmit port kept TX_ENABLE high, left its ring address at
the freed buffer and stayed clocked, and a port whose enable was
taken away mid-stream stayed silent forever.

Quiesce the port and drop its clock in hw_free unless another stream
still claims the word, keep the mute/volume stage non-bypassed with
unity gain and a fade so a mute or soft-stop never clicks, cross-check
the port's own read pointer in the tick and report a port that stops
draining as an underrun, and take the sample width from the params:
S32_LE is a 32-bit container for a 24-bit sample, which is what the
precision field selects.

Constrain period and buffer sizes to the 128-byte burst the block
walks its ring in, refuse a DAI format the port cannot answer, and
expose the mute state as a Playback Switch control.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 1 file changed, 265 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)


